# Architecture Guardrails

- Run /grill-me before starting new product behavior.
- Keep MCP tool handlers thin; put reusable logic in src/domain.
- Do not create monolithic entry files.
- Keep AGENTS.md, docs/architecture-contract.md, and docs/build-plan.md aligned.
- Run npm run typecheck, npm test, and npm run build before handing off.
